Feature: DocString Feature

  Scenario: Step with a single-line DocString
    Given I receive the following body
    """
    Hello World
    """

  Scenario: Step with a multi-line DocString
    Given I receive the following body
    """
    Line One
    Line Two
    Line Three
    """

  Scenario: Step with a DocString after regular steps
    Given I perform setup
    When I receive the following body
    """
    First paragraph

    Second paragraph after blank line
    """
    Then I verify the result
